cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ROS 2 Visual Programming IDE: graph-based orchestration of robotic trajectories"
abstract: >-
  Low-code visual programming environment for ROS 2. Robot motion
  sequences are built by connecting blocks in the browser; a graph
  evaluator validates them as a path graph and orders them with Kahn's
  algorithm, and an asynchronous Rust engine executes them natively on
  ROS 2 through r2r. A declarative hardware abstraction layer drives
  velocity-controlled mobile bases and joint-position-controlled
  manipulators. Software version described in the undergraduate thesis
  "Desarrollo de un entorno de programación visual basado en grafos para
  la orquestación de trayectorias robóticas bajo el estándar ROS 2",
  Universidad Militar Nueva Granada, 2026.
